	(text "1. SLEEP CURRENT=16.8uA/6.0mA(NO SV./WITH SV.)\n2. Battery 14500/800mAh\n	energy dencity = 3.7V*0.8Ah/(3.14*1.4cm^2/4*5cm/1000mL/L)\n	= 2.96Wh / 7.693mL = 385Wh/L < 400Wh/L PSE not needed.\n3. Battery capacity measured = 500mAh at load = 5.1ohm\n4. LED current = (3.3 - 2.56) / 100 = 7.4mA\n5. MG-90S Minimum operation voltage = 3.1V(measured)\n6. @3.8V Current = 95mA(WiFi connected)/ 600mA(str. locked)/\n    215mA(rot. ON)/ 250mA(rot. + Oscillate str.) \n7. @3.8V Deep sleep current = 5.8mA\n8. Changed from 04: Add clearance between +4V and H2PAD.\n9. CHG SW1\n2025.12.20 CHG LED3\n2026.01.11 CHG R7,R8 SHOULD BE 5.1K\n2026.01.12 CHG R5,R6 REWORKED TO 5.1K\n2026.01.16 ADD OPTION FOR AUTO PILOT\n2026.04.30 ADD OPTION FOR TRAVEL ENCODER\n2026.05.05 CHG R7,R8 REWORKED*2 TO 3.3K\n2026.05.24 RMK MINIMUM OPERATING VOLTAGE=3.00V(MEASURED)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 155.575 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
